        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix: fix internationalization translations for agents",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\r\n\r\nResolves a problem where users switching the UI to Chinese would still see English text in the Agent > Tools > Quick Presets area and in the Dreaming confirmation flow.\r\n\r\n## Why This Change Was Made\r\n\r\nThis change fills in the missing Chinese translations for the agent tool profile presets and Dreaming-related prompts, and ensures built-in tool profile labels use the localized UI copy even when the runtime catalog returns English labels. The scope is intentionally limited to presentation text so behavior and backend data flow remain unchanged.\r\n\r\n## User Impact\r\n\r\nUsers who use the Chinese UI now see consistent localized labels for agent tool presets, Cron Jobs, Dreaming on/off status, and the Dreaming restart confirmation dialog. This makes the Agent settings surface feel fully translated instead of partially mixed-language.\r\n\r\n## Evidence\r\n\r\n- Added Chinese translations for the affected labels in `zh-CN`.\r\n- Local lint checks passed for the modified files.\r\n \r\nscreenshot: \r\nbefore：\r\n<img width=\"549\" height=\"237\" alt=\"截屏2026-07-12 23 34 51\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42be2a7a-782e-4314-8536-650721c05efc\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1034\" height=\"379\" alt=\"截屏2026-07-12 23 34 13\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ba98ed0-7357-4a56-bbe6-826ed9128e77\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nafter：\r\n<img width=\"560\" height=\"228\" alt=\"截屏2026-07-12 23 18 52\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed5cb649-a929-4b0a-99b4-9fbd46aeb53c\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1004\" height=\"414\" alt=\"截屏2026-07-12 23 19 36\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dfe74f90-58f9-4ce2-bd2d-c4e32b359f1c\" />\r\n\r\n✅ pnpm ui:i18n:sync — all 20 locales clean (changed=false, fallbacks=0)\r\n✅ pnpm ui:i18n:check — all 20 locales pass\r\n.i18n/ metadata is already up-to-date with main; no regeneration output to commit.\r\n\r\nopenclaw version: 2026.7.2\r\n",
